(delta :turn 5
  ; Built and published as Claude artifact. Data sourced from
  ; gemini-proto-pro-re2.wno (48 nodes, 39 edges, 59 terms,
  ; 12 deltas). Features implemented:
  ;
  ; 1. Stat tiles: nodes, edges, terms, tokens, edge types
  ; 2. Four-band tier map: fire/hot/warm/cold swim lanes with
  ;    node pills showing frame-type dot + id + status badge.
  ;    Sorted by frame type within each band.
  ; 3. Detail panel on click: frame type, status, tier with
  ;    reason (touched/actionable/edge-held/cold), by, mass,
  ;    last touch delta, full payload, connected edges
  ;    (clickable for navigation), digest rendering preview
  ;    (shows how node would appear in each tier's rendering).
  ; 4. Edge overlay: toggleable SVG edge paths with hover
  ;    tooltips showing edge type + endpoints. Selected node
  ;    highlights its edges and peer nodes.
  ; 5. Yield curve: line chart (nodes/terms/edges vs delta),
  ;    2px lines, 8px endpoint dots, end labels, hairline grid.
  ; 6. Table view toggle: sortable table with all node fields.
  ; 7. Frame legend: colored dots with counts.
  ; 8. Both light and dark themes, thermal color scheme
  ;    (amber fire → sienna hot → stone warm → steel cold).
  ;
  ; Design: temperature-gradient palette for tier identity,
  ; monospace for IDs/code, system sans for UI. No external
  ; dependencies (artifact CSP). Responsive layout.
  ;
  (add (claim c2 (built tier-visualizer artifact published all-features) :by assistant :src t5))
  (add (claim c3 (data-source gemini-proto-pro-re2 48n-39e-59t-12d) :by assistant :src t5))
